{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1000_p", "source_sha256": "40403ce35350524ac12fa736ae4d0fb756518f617878b4ae4a13c89df9ba8fc4", "ja": "（今日のライブは、未来の希望で『素敵なキセキ』を\n披露した。歌い終えた未来は充実した表情だ！）", "zh": "（今天的演唱会由未来怀着希望，献上了《美好的奇迹》。唱完歌的未来，脸上洋溢着充实的表情！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "adf2079cd700a314defea41d0d708b177572f8582497ef294d7ca09c71ce3f40", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私のワガママを\nきいてくれて……ありがとうございましたっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你\n听了我的任性要求……非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "c5d4b9b2ac53b404d87058c5b4d3d15d21f4cc6861e812d94c7edbfec19f992d", "ja": "その……今日のステージ、どうでしたか？\n楽しんでくれましたか？", "zh": "那个……今天的舞台，感觉怎么样？\n你看得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4aaefb5f5399d3ae2ab174f79e03dad32f5394edca312620b3fcff4c0ed8942d", "ja": "もちろん。楽しそうな未来の姿が見られて、\nこっちまで楽しい気分になれたよ。", "zh": "当然。看到未来开心的样子，我也跟着高兴起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "964078d675f22453669514ba720364a0199c3bd5e65a1ba75cf3db3dc4e76d2a", "ja": "！！　よ、よかった～……。", "zh": "！！　太、太好了～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "4a2c71404829f615ba03a0b9926db0218bceeca588a7df58b628b600ef668f5a", "ja": "今日のライブは、{$P$}さんに\n絶対楽しんでもらいたいって思ってたんです♪", "zh": "我一直希望今天的演出能让{$P$}先生尽情享受♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "b5292dd2b80668da34a088090f5671d85d2aa76542224814b89cddbc696d57cc", "ja": "あっ。今日だけじゃなくて、いつも思ってますよ！\nでも、今日はすっごくいいライブになると思ったから。", "zh": "啊，不只是今天，我一直都是这么想的哦！\n不过，因为我觉得今天一定会是一场特别棒的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0005d9fa890932461967866ff47ab92eec20d5f2f33a75b00e9ed05f874cd693", "ja": "え？　ライブが始まる前から、\n未来はそんな風に思ってたのか？", "zh": "诶？未来在演唱会开始之前，就已经这么想了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "415b3af92247b4de98dc3ccfdac257f3cd3e03fe3d99c3276338e7430468e7da", "ja": "はい、なんとなく！　いいお天気ですし、\nみんなで思いっきり歌ったら楽しいだろうなって。", "zh": "嗯，大概就是这样！今天天气也很好，我就觉得，要是大家一起尽情歌唱，一定会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "2fcad44898cabdf8bcf716cfbc599c23853e6cdfa561d33655f1ea0cd1eee298", "ja": "だからステージに出たら楽しくなっちゃって……。\nあの～……それで……。", "zh": "所以一上台就不知不觉开心起来了……  \n那个～……然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e16373aa49a3c40c46c40033b9741442f332078d54aeffbaf4ac806b36586712", "ja": "？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "22adab9322768708befb50a204461ef59f9b64a90b2d13c1d73d1b8e0f388e22", "ja": "私、前より歌が上手くなったとか、なかったですか！？", "zh": "我，是不是比以前唱歌更好了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "ede0d471857a625ab5254c90af4825c0929a6991b75c9b99042160d3f679efc1", "ja": "あっ！　えっと、褒めてほしいとか、そういう\nわけじゃなくて！　ただ……少しだけ気になって。", "zh": "啊！那个，我不是想让你夸我，才不是那回事！只是……稍微有点在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1013_p", "source_sha256": "93b1b7517aec7fef0d8231dc7356aed4ffa2c2e0a54a0b7a02d5a9ae0bcddd88", "ja": "……そうだな。前よりも\nもっと未来らしいステージになったって思ったよ。", "zh": "……也是呢。我觉得这场演出\n比之前更加有未来的风格了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d8b281b45115b22f4f12d598030cbb35056f08dd158e5bf53673c6c753cb2822", "ja": "未来と同じように、会場にいる人たちも楽しい気持ちに\nなるライブだったなって。", "zh": "我觉得这是一场和未来一样，也能让会场里的人们感到开心的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "b69ee11e4745b11ed919b8a4aff4acc25e9805332c81e91a63ba53d208f6fb5e", "ja": "……！　でへへ～♪\nそう言ってもらえて安心しました。", "zh": "……！　嘿嘿～♪\n听您这么说，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1016_p", "source_sha256": "25dfc1381fcd94f2735a472245f7b4aeee8cf1f0500591b9ccfcc965deed17ab", "ja": "安心？", "zh": "放心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "2845a04b0d11f5206a3c2aff004971e8d4665e98eaf7584cccad671aa0c75257", "ja": "だって、同じ曲のステージを何回も見ると、\nちょっとずつ飽きてきちゃうかもって思って……。", "zh": "因为我觉得，同一首歌的舞台看很多次的话，可能会一点点觉得腻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "57b7ada7650fcc99b92eed28999b0270b641c40ed98f609e177f214cb29fa0a9", "ja": "でも『素敵なキセキ』は私にとって特別な曲だし、\nこれからも、いっぱい歌いたいから……。", "zh": "但是，《美好的奇迹》对我来说是一首特别的歌，以后也想一直唱很多次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "5eb09c874599e16faadf1cc9d2b2e3776ae1b210e3ad75bf9e1e5c5fb713718c", "ja": "{$P$}さんが楽しんでくれるなら、\n私、自信を持って何回でも歌える気がします！", "zh": "只要{$P$}先生能乐在其中，\n我觉得自己就能满怀信心地唱上无数次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6ad3a4143f046e2fa61b46f0999f98f68375233be096533fde35afddebc37372", "ja": "未来……。そういうことなら、心配しなくていい！", "zh": "未来……。既然是这样，就不用担心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2f0a63f017104ab974bdc23693d03385dfae5c5d8e2fabefb40f66e6409eee38", "ja": "未来が楽しんでくれて、その気持ちを届けたいって\n思う限り、同じライブにはならないと思うよ。", "zh": "只要未来能享受其中，并且想把这份心情传达出去，我觉得每场演出都会有所不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "a3c6d04d0ef81a445941760940e6db2d2ef00d701032edbd6b0454990c302cac", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nえへへ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n嘿嘿，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0704_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "831c63c03879d1c3c552dde9445b0eeb338c43504ae433fabf53f3fb93df8448", "ja": "私、たくさん成長して……いーっぱい楽しい気持ちを\n届けます！　だから楽しみにしててくださいね！", "zh": "我会不断成长……把满满的快乐心情传递给大家！所以请期待我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
